<===> README.md
A partial match of a multi-character pattern (the first `/` of `//`, or the
first bytes of a UTF-8 BOM) must not move the reported column. LibSass used
to report these errors one column too far to the right.
<===>
================================================================================
<===> silent_comment_then_loud_comment/input.scss
// c
/* d */ a {b: (}
<===> silent_comment_then_loud_comment/error-libsass
Error: expected ")".
  ,
2 | /* d */ a {b: (}
  |                ^
  '
  input.scss 2:16  root stylesheet
